#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.pivot.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.pivot"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:1 of
msgid "Return reshaped LiteFrame organized by given index / column values."
msgstr "返回按给定 index / column 值重新组织的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:3 of
msgid ""
"Reshape data based on column values.  Uses unique values from specified "
"``index`` / ``columns`` to form axes of the resulting LiteFrame.  This "
"function does not support data aggregation -- multiple values for an "
"index/column pair raise ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"基于列值重塑数据。使用指定的 ``index`` / ``columns`` 的唯一值来构成结果 "
"LiteFrame 的轴。此函数不支持数据聚合 —— 如果某个 index/column 对存在多个"
"值，则抛出 ``ValueError``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:7 of
msgid "Source LiteFrame."
msgstr "源 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:9 of
msgid "Column(s) whose distinct values become the new columns."
msgstr "其不同值将成为新列的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:10 of
msgid "Column(s) to use as the row index of the result."
msgstr "用作结果行索引的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:12 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to populate the new frame's values.  If ``None``, all "
"non-index/non-columns columns are used."
msgstr ""
"用于填充新数据框值的列。如果为 ``None``，则使用所有非 index、非 columns "
"的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:16 of
msgid ""
"Reshaped LiteFrame.  Index columns appear first, followed by one column "
"per distinct ``columns`` value."
msgstr ""
"重塑后的 LiteFrame。索引列在前，其后是每个不同 ``columns`` 值对应的一列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot of
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:19 of
msgid ""
"When there are any ``index`` / ``columns`` combinations with multiple "
"values.  Use ``pivot_table`` when you need to aggregate."
msgstr ""
"当存在任何具有多个值的 ``index`` / ``columns`` 组合时抛出。如需聚合，请使用 "
"``pivot_table``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:23 of
msgid ":py:obj:`pivot_table`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot:24 of
msgid "Pivot table with aggregation."
msgstr "带聚合的数据透视表。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reshape.pivot_table.pivot of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""
